  "summary": "Cerfa 15763*02, known as the S1106, is the form you send to French public health insurance (Assurance Maladie) to open your right to have your healthcare costs covered when you are not yet attached to a French social security scheme. You fill it in when you start working in France or, if you do not work, once you live in France in a stable and regular way, usually after 3 months.",
